---
import LandingLayout from '@/layouts/LandingLayout.astro';
import { Hero } from '@/components/hero';
import Button from '@/components/ui/form/Button/Button.astro';
import Badge from '@/components/ui/data-display/Badge/Badge.astro';
import Card from '@/components/ui/data-display/Card/Card.astro';
import Icon from '@/components/ui/primitives/Icon/Icon.astro';
---

<LandingLayout
  title="Steel Wagstaff"
  description="Curious human trying to do good things for good reasons."
  image="/og-default.svg"
  includePersonSchema={true}
>  
  <section class="relative z-10 py-[var(--space-section-md)] bg-background border-t border-border">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
      <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2">
        <!-- Left Column: About Text -->
        <div class="flex flex-col justify-center is-visible" data-reveal="">
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 mb-6">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center font-medium border transition-colors [&>svg]:shrink-0 [&>svg]:h-3 [&>svg]:w-3 bg-brand-500/10 text-brand-600 border-brand-500/20 dark:text-brand-400 text-sm sm:text-xs py-1 gap-1.5 rounded-full shadow-sm px-3.5 sm:px-3 self-start">
              Who I am
            </span>
            <h1 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-foreground">
              Steel Wagstaff<br />
              <span class="text-brand-500 text-3xl md:text-4xl">radically open maker</span>
            </h1>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-4 text-lg text-foreground-muted leading-relaxed">
            <p>I'm an inveterately curious person trying to do good things for good reasons. I want to collaborate with diverse groups of people to address social problems without violence or domination.</p>
            <p>We are all many selves, with overlapping, shifting interests, affinities, and affections. I have tried to ground my life in generosity, mutual aid, and compassion. Some of my deepest, most enduring commitments include being a father, partner, and friend; reading and sharing poems (especially the <a href="https://theobjectivists.org/" class="text-brand-500 hover:underline">Objectivists</a>); appreciating public libraries, live music, and international films; and playing pub trivia, pickup soccer, and basketball.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right Column: Profile Image -->
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center is-visible" data-reveal="true" data-reveal-delay="1">
          <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border-4 border-brand-500/20">
              <img 
                src="/steel_wagstaff.jpg" 
                alt="Steel Wagstaff" 
                class="w-full h-full object-cover"
              />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- About Section -->
  <section class="relative z-10 py-[var(--space-section-md)] bg-background-secondary border-t border-border">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
      <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2">
        <!-- Left Column: Profile Image -->
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center is-visible" data-reveal>
          <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border-4 border-brand-500/20">
            <img 
              src="/pb_team.jpg" 
              alt="the Pressbooks Team" 
              class="w-full h-full object-cover"
            />
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right Column: What I do -->
        <div class="flex flex-col justify-center is-visible" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 mb-6">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center font-medium border transition-colors [&>svg]:shrink-0 [&>svg]:h-3 [&>svg]:w-3 bg-brand-500/10 text-brand-600 border-brand-500/20 dark:text-brand-400 text-sm sm:text-xs py-1 gap-1.5 rounded-full shadow-sm px-3.5 sm:px-3 self-start">
              My work
            </span>
          <h2 class="font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-foreground mb-6">
            What I do
          </h2>
        </div>  
          <div class="space-y-4 text-lg text-foreground-muted leading-relaxed">
            <p>
              For nearly eight years, I worked as the product manager and customer experience lead for <a href="https://pressbooks.com" class="text-brand-500 hover:underline">Pressbooks</a>, 
              a small Canadian company that makes open-source book publishing software.</p>
              <p>I have also taught writing and literature to college students and incarcerated men, 
              served as a faculty consultant and instructional designer at a large public university, built websites, worked as a land surveyor, cared for and tutored children, and worked as a cashier in a toy store.
            </p>
            <p>Learn more about my professional work on GitHub or LinkedIn.</p>
            <div class="flex gap-4">
            <a href="https://github.com/steelwagstaff" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-brand-500 hover:text-brand-600 font-semibold transition-colors">
              <Icon name="github" size="md" />
              GitHub
            </a>
            <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/steel-wagstaff" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-brand-500 hover:text-brand-600 font-semibold transition-colors">
              <Icon name="linkedin" size="md" />
              LinkedIn
            </a>
          </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Content Areas -->
  <section class="relative z-10 py-[var(--space-section-md)] bg-background border-t border-border">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6">
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-4 text-center mb-12" data-reveal>
          <span class="inline-flex items-center font-medium border transition-colors [&>svg]:shrink-0 [&>svg]:h-3 [&>svg]:w-3 bg-brand-500/10 text-brand-600 border-brand-500/20 dark:text-brand-400 text-sm sm:text-xs py-1 gap-1.5 rounded-full shadow-sm px-3.5 sm:px-3">
              Things I've Made
            </span>
          <h2 class="font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-foreground">
          Explore past projects
          </h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-foreground-muted max-w-2xl">
          I love DIY projects and learning to make new things. Some of these creative projects are presented here, sorted into a few categories.
        </p>
        </div>  
        
      <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1">
        <!-- Radio + Podcasts -->
        <a href="/radio-podcasts" class="block rounded-xl transition-all duration-200 ease-out bg-card border border-brand-500/30 shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl hover:border-brand-500/70 p-6 group">
          <div class="flex flex-col h-full">
            <div class="mb-4 w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-500/20 to-brand-500/5 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-500">
              <Icon name="music" size="md" />
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mb-2 group-hover:text-brand-500 transition-colors">
              Radio + Podcasts
            </h3>
            <p class="text-foreground-muted flex-1 mb-4">
              Playlists, mixtapes, college radio shows, and episodes from two podcasts I made in grad school.
            </p>
            <span class="text-sm text-brand-500 font-semibold group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform inline-flex items-center gap-1">
              Explore <Icon name="arrow-right" size="sm" />
            </span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <!-- Writing + Storytelling -->
        <a href="/writing-storytelling" class="block rounded-xl transition-all duration-200 ease-out bg-card border border-brand-500/30 shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl hover:border-brand-500/70 p-6 group">
          <div class="flex flex-col h-full">
            <div class="mb-4 w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-500/20 to-brand-500/5 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-500">
              <Icon name="book-open" size="md" />
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mb-2 group-hover:text-brand-500 transition-colors">
              Writing + Storytelling
            </h3>
            <p class="text-foreground-muted flex-1 mb-4">
              Stories, essays, and reflections on poetry, open education, and other sundry topics.
            </p>
            <span class="text-sm text-brand-500 font-semibold group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform inline-flex items-center gap-1">
              Explore <Icon name="arrow-right" size="sm" />
            </span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <!-- The Commonplace -->
        <a href="/commonplace" class="block rounded-xl transition-all duration-200 ease-out bg-card border border-accent/30 shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl hover:border-accent/70 p-6 group">
          <div class="flex flex-col h-full">
            <div class="mb-4 w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-accent/20 to-accent/5 flex items-center justify-center text-accent">
              <Icon name="bookmark" size="md" />
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mb-2 group-hover:text-accent transition-colors">
              The Commonplace
            </h3>
            <p class="text-foreground-muted flex-1 mb-4">
              A digital commonplace book filled with words, images, videos, and songs worth remembering.
            </p>
            <span class="text-sm text-accent font-semibold group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform inline-flex items-center gap-1">
              Explore <Icon name="arrow-right" size="sm" />
            </span>
          </div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Contact Section -->
  <section class="relative z-10 py-[var(--space-section-md)] bg-background border-t border-border">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
      <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2">
        <!-- Left Column: About Text -->
        <div class="flex flex-col justify-center is-visible" data-reveal="">
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 mb-6">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center font-medium border transition-colors [&>svg]:shrink-0 [&>svg]:h-3 [&>svg]:w-3 bg-brand-500/10 text-brand-600 border-brand-500/20 dark:text-brand-400 text-sm sm:text-xs py-1 gap-1.5 rounded-full shadow-sm px-3.5 sm:px-3 self-start">
              Let's talk
            </span>
             <h2 class="font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-foreground mb-6">
              Only connect!
            </h2>
          </div>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-lg text-foreground-muted leading-relaxed">
          <p>I make my home in <em>kalapuya iliʔi</em> (Eugene, Oregon) with <a href="https://teaching.uoregon.edu/about/tep-staff-directory#:~:text=in%20the%20UK.-,Laurel%20Bastian,-Associate%20Director" class="text-brand-500 hover:underline">Laurel Bastian</a>, our son, a small dog, and three chickens.</p>
          <p>Our most precious possession is our attention. I'm trying to cultivate and direct my attention towards the things I love most. I am always happy to meet other people with similar orientations.</p>
          <p>If you want to discuss poetry, educational publishing, open-source software, worker cooperatives, climate restoration, non-violent social justice actions, developing "third spaces", anarchism, Engaged Buddhism, or just say hello, feel free to <a rel="me" href="https://social.coop/@steelwagstaff" class="text-brand-500 hover:underline">contact me through Mastodon</a>. If you want to discuss working together in a professional capacity, use <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/steel-wagstaff" class="text-brand-500 hover:underline">LinkedIn</a>.</p>
           <div class="flex gap-4">
            <a rel="me" href="https://social.coop/@steelwagstaff" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-brand-500 hover:text-brand-600 font-semibold transition-colors">
              <Icon name="mastodon" size="md" />
              Mastodon
            </a>
            <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/steel-wagstaff" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-brand-500 hover:text-brand-600 font-semibold transition-colors">
              <Icon name="linkedin" size="md" />
              LinkedIn
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      
        </div>

        <!-- Right Column: Flower Image -->
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center is-visible" data-reveal="true" data-reveal-delay="1">
          <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border-4 border-brand-500/20">
            <img 
              src="/spring_camas.jpg" 
              alt="Spring camas" 
              class="w-full h-full object-cover"
            />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</LandingLayout>